# API — Architecture

| Couche | Où |
|--------|-----|
| HTTP | `modules/*/*.controller.ts` |
| Auth | `modules/auth/` JWT + `JwtAuthGuard` |
| Métier | `modules/*/*.service.ts` |
| DB | `entities/` + `database/` TypeORM |
| DTO | `modules/*/dto/` |
| Notif | BullMQ → providers Resend/Twilio |

`userId` = `payload.sub`.

Détail : `.cursor/skills/api-stack/architecture.md`

```ts
@Controller('tasks')
@UseGuards(JwtAuthGuard)
export class TasksController {
  @Get()
  findAll(@CurrentUser() user: AuthUser) {
    return this.tasksService.findAll(user.id); // ✅
  }
}
```
